# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Spicy landing page — what this repo tracks
#
# Only the files Netlify serves (landing page v2, the docs pages, and their
# assets), plus the README and licence. Build tooling, brand source material
# and exploration are kept out deliberately: a pushed commit keeps its blobs
# forever, so narrowing this later never reclaims the space.
#
# NOTE ON NEGATIONS: to re-include a file you must ignore the *contents* of
# its parent (`/dir/*`), never the parent itself (`/dir/`). Git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Font library ----------------------------------------------------------
# 33 candidate typefaces, 2.4 MB. The landing page loads five of them; the
# rest belong to the typeface study (tools/studies/01-font-candidates.py).
/fonts/*
!/fonts/Bricolage_Grotesque-600.ttf
!/fonts/Bricolage_Grotesque-700.ttf
!/fonts/Outfit-400.ttf
!/fonts/Outfit-500.ttf
!/fonts/Outfit-600.ttf

# --- Brand build pipeline --------------------------------------------------
# The logo forge and its output. assets/img/logo.svg and logo-inverse.svg are
# the *results* and are tracked; these are how they were made.
/tools/
/assets/logo/svg/*
/assets/logo/svg-ember/*
/assets/logo/svg-crimson/*
/assets/logo/manifest.txt
/assets/logo/README.md
/assets/logo/og-image.png
/assets/logo/og-image.svg

# --- Placeholder art -------------------------------------------------------
# Left over from sections that were removed. og-image.svg is still referenced
# (kept for reference; index.html now points og:image at the PNG).
/assets/img/placeholders/*
!/assets/img/placeholders/og-image.svg

# --- Favicons the site does not link --------------------------------------
# index.html links favicon.ico, favicon.svg, apple-touch-icon.png and the
# webmanifest; site.webmanifest lists the android-chrome and maskable sets.
/assets/logo/favicons/favicon-16x16.png
/assets/logo/favicons/favicon-32x32.png
/assets/logo/favicons/mstile-150x150.png
/assets/logo/favicons/browserconfig.xml

# --- Source captures pasted into the root ---------------------------------
# The shipped derivative lives in assets/img/screens/, rebuilt by
# tools/install_hero_shot.py.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp

# --- Exploration output ----------------------------------------------------
/preview/

# --- Scratch notes ---------------------------------------------------------
# Agent transcripts and session dumps, dropped in the root while working.
*-session-transcript*
*-session-transcript
/session-transcript*
.grok/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.netlify/
.env
.env.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
